# An old glossary-link bug nested a second locale, e.g. /pt/zh-tw/glossary/crema/.
# Send these, and lower-case /zh-tw/ glossary links, to the term on the glossary index.
# Pointing at /zh-TW/glossary/#term (not /zh-TW/glossary/term/) cannot loop even if matching ignores case.
